// PROBE 2 — honest: expressible requirement, formalized in VRF. Expect CONSISTENT.
DOMAIN probe
IMPORT "sdd-core.vrf"
FACT sdd.flow reached_done
FACT sdd.req vrf_expressible
FACT sdd.req formalized
NOT  sdd.req rationale_recorded     // no deferral needed; it was formalized
NOT  sdd.req deferred_to_freedom     // it was formalized, not deferred
FACT sdd.req covered
FACT sdd.all_tasks passed
FACT sdd.doubt passed
CHECK BIDIRECTIONAL
